    subgraph cluster_matrix {
        label="Matrix Dimensions";
        style=filled;
        color=lightgray;
        fontsize=14;
        fontname="Arial Bold";
        
        E [label="KIND Images\n(K8s 1.25-1.32)", fillcolor=lightcyan];
        F [label="Test Categories\n(onlylatest/allversions)", fillcolor=lightcyan];
    }
    
    A -> B [penwidth=3];
    B -> C [penwidth=3];
    C -> D [penwidth=3];
    B -> E [penwidth=2, style=dashed];
    B -> F [penwidth=2, style=dashed];
}
```

### 3. Build Workflows

**Purpose**: Builds and validates Helm charts

**Triggers**:
- Pull requests
- Push to main
- Tag creation
- Dev branch pushes

**Components Built**:
- Helm charts with templated configurations
- Chart documentation and metadata

**Artifact Storage**:
- Helm charts: GitHub Releases and GitHub Pages

### 4. Release Workflows

**Purpose**: Manages versioned releases of the Helm chart collection

**Triggers**:
- Tag creation (semantic versioning)
- Manual dispatch for hotfixes

**Release Process**:
```dot
